br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/d08dce9149fdf730be6518c01c1c8cea.avif?t=1765885689\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter One is a complete  story, that will become part of a bigger world. Each Chapter will be a stand alone adventure that can be played in any order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.webp?t=1765885689\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.poster.avif?t=1765885689\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras_big/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.webp?t=1765885689 width=800 height=456 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own choices to try and escape your trial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/48e75e17c57483d303d48030cace2bba.webp?t=1765885689\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/48e75e17c57483d303d48030cace2bba.poster.avif?t=1765885689\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras_big/48e75e17c57483d303d48030cace2bba.webp?t=1765885689 width=800 height=456 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all 30 endings, and find the secret Hidden Ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/489f1813c6a3072d8cdb3a2daae3af54.webp?t=1765885689\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/489f1813c6a3072d8cdb3a2daae3af54.poster.avif?t=1765885689\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras_big/489f1813c6a3072d8cdb3a2daae3af54.webp?t=1765885689 width=800 height=456 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many deaths await you, but don't be discouraged, you can try again. There must be some safe paths... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/d44225a1253291e24e481018f9504457.avif?t=1765885689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras_big/d44225a1253291e24e481018f9504457.avif?t=1765885689 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/227b9df4eaa1f266e75b46c2401cd21d.avif?t=1765885689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras_big/227b9df4eaa1f266e75b46c2401cd21d.avif?t=1765885689 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Hama Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/09e4eb117a77b7be3781e884b27daa2efe32cdd7/header.jpg?t=1765885689","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568470/1358455201/f313a25ad780245ff1edd031f23ed461e7ef5bff/1753178438/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754738067","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568470/1358455201/f313a25ad780245ff1edd031f23ed461e7ef5bff/1753178438/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754738067","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"ht